vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm), Apache License 2.0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party/vllm_overlay/vllm/ contains files from vLLM 0.13.0, modified to
implement pause-token compression, cache compaction and per-layer quotas. The
patches under third_party/vllm_overlay_async/ and third_party/vllm_overlay_lt/
apply to the same files. The upstream license is third_party/vllm_overlay/LICENSE.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
microsoft/memento (https://github.com/microsoft/memento), MIT License
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party/vllm_overlay began as the microsoft/memento vLLM overlay: its
block-masking scheduler, request tracking and cache compaction (28 of the
overlay's Python files, plus install_overlay.sh) are carried over and
modified. The pause-token compression, per-layer quotas and packed KV storage
(vllm/config/compresslm.py, vllm/v1/core/compresslm/, vllm/v1/worker/compresslm_*.py
and related files) are new.

