Baselines (not redistributed)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
abridgekv/lightthinker.py is our reimplementation of LightThinker
(https://github.com/zjunlp/LightThinker, MIT). scripts/test_lightthinker_mask.py
compares it against their code, imported from a separate clone.
R-KV results use the authors' own vLLM port (https://github.com/Zefan-Cai/R-KV);
launch/eval_suite.sh only sets its environment variables.
